---
Stat, list and search files in the project's roots: the Fs port for people and agents (ADR 0339)

Usage: specforge files <COMMAND>

Commands:
  stat    Each path's kind, size and modification time, or that it does not exist
  list    The files and directories under a directory, honouring .gitignore
  search  The lines under the paths that match a regular expression
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help
